,\n410\t          \"2v3\": {\n411\t            \"auc\": 0.5623,\n412\t            \"ci\": [\n413\t              0.5524,\n414\t              0.5722\n415\t            ],\n416\t            \"perm_p\": 0\n417\t          },\n418\t          \"3v4\": {\n419\t            \"auc\": 0.5215,\n420\t            \"ci\": [\n421\t              0.5108,\n422\t              0.5322\n423\t            ],\n424\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n425\t          },\n426\t          \"4v5\": {\n427\t            \"auc\": 0.5147,\n428\t            \"ci\": [\n429\t              0.504,\n430\t              0.5254\n431\t            ],\n432\t            \"perm_p\": 0.0052\n433\t          }\n434\t        }\n435\t      },\n436\t      \"auc_1v2_range\": [\n437\t        0.6482,\n438\t        0.6671\n439\t      ],\n440\t      \"auc_1v2_spread\": 0.0189,\n441\t      \"cross_decoding_feature_spearman\": 0.87,\n442\t      \"method\": \"GroupKFold(5) OOF + doc-level bootstrap + label permutation\",\n443\t      \"resamples\": 10000\n444\t    },\n445\t    \"tables\": [\n446\t      {\n447\t        \"title\": \"Pythia-1.4B Decoding Ablation Summary\",\n448\t        \"columns\": [\n449\t          \"decoding\",\n450\t          \"AUC_1v2\",\n451\t          \"CI_lower\",\n452\t          \"CI_upper\",\n453\t          \"AUC_2v3\",\n454\t          \"2v3_CI_upper\",\n455\t          \"K_star\"\n456\t        ],\n457\t        \"rows\": [\n458\t          [\n459\t            \"greedy\",\n460\t            0.6482,\n461\t            0.6391,\n462\t            0.6573,\n463\t            0.5538,\n464\t            0.5635,\n465\t            2\n466\t          ],\n467\t          [\n468\t            \"nucleus p=0.9\",\n469\t            0.6512,\n470\t            0.6422,\n471\t            0.6602,\n472\t            0.5567,\n473\t            0.5665,\n474\t            2\n475\t          ],\n476\t          [\n477\t            \"T=0.7\",\n478\t            0.6498,\n479\t            0.6407,\n480\t            0.6589,\n481\t            0.5551,\n482\t            0.5649,\n483\t            2\n484\t          ],\n485\t          [\n486\t            \"T=1.2\",\n487\t            0.6671,\n488\t            0.6579,\n489\t            0.6763,\n490\t            0.5623,\n491\t            0.5722,\n492\t            2\n493\t          ]\n494\t        ]\n495\t      },\n496\t      {\n497\t        \"title\": \"Cross-model Decoding Invariance Comparison\",\n498\t        \"columns\": [\n499\t          \"model\",\n500\t          \"decoding_configs\",\n501\t          \"1v2_range\",\n502\t          \"range_width\",\n503\t          \"all_K_star_2\"\n504\t        ],\n505\t        \"rows\": [\n506\t          [\n507\t            \"Qwen-1.5B (exp-003)\",\n508\t            4,\n509\t            \"[0.6866, 0.7039]\",\n510\t            0.0173,\n511\t            \"✅\"\n512\t          ],\n513\t          [\n514\t            \"Pythia-1.4B (exp-020)\",\n515\t            4,\n516\t            \"[0.6482, 0.6671]\",\n517\t            0.0189,\n518\t            \"✅\"\n519\t          ]\n520\t        ]\n521\t      }\n522\t    ],\n523\t    \"figures\": [],\n524\t    \"analysis\": \"Pythia 4/4 decoding configs K*=2 确认 decoding invariance 是跨模型的普遍现象。\\n论文 claim 从 \\\"4 decoding strategies (single model)\\\" 升级为 \\\"8 decoding configurations across 2 models\\\"。\\nT=1.2 在两个模型上都给出最高 1v2 AUC（Qwen 0.7039, Pythia 0.6671），\\n机制一致：高温采样放大 next-token 分布的尾部，使 gen-1 的 surprisal 分布特征更显著偏离 gen-0。\\n但即便如此，2v3 仍然 < 0.60——DPI 的信息饱和在 K*=2 处仍然成立。\\nFeature importance Spearman=0.87 (cross-decoding within Pythia) 高于 0.53 (cross-decoding within Qwen, exp-003)，\\n说明 Pythia 的特征排序对解码策略更稳定，可能因为 Pythia 架构更简单（无 GQA/RoPE enhancements）。\\n\\n\\nexp-003 在 Qwen2.5-1.5B 上已证明 4/4 decoding strategies K*=2，1v2 range=[0.6866, 0.7039]。\\nPythia-1.4B 基准 1v2=0.6539 (nucleus p=0.95, exp-001)，预测 4 种解码的 1v2 range=[0.6482, 0.6671]：\\n(1) Greedy (0.6482): 确定性解码减少输出多样性，gen-1 更接近\\\"平均化\\\"的文本，\\n    相比 nucleus 0.95 的 0.6539 略低，因为 greedy 的低熵输出使 surprisal 方差特征的区分度微降；\\n(2) Nucleus p=0.9 (0.6512): 接近 baseline 的 p=0.95，差异极小；\\n(3) T=0.7 (0.6498): 低温采样与 greedy 类似，轻微压缩分布尾部；\\n(4) T=1.2 (0.6671): 高温增加输出多样性，gen-1 文本的统计特征偏离更明显，\\n    1v2 区分度升高——与 exp-003 中 T=1.2 给出最高 AUC (0.7039) 的模式完全一致；\\n(5) Range=0.0189 << Qwen 的 0.0173，说明 Pythia 对解码策略的敏感度与 Qwen 量级相当；\\n(6) 所有 4 个 config 的 CI lower 均 > 0.639，远高于 θ=0.60，margin 充裕；\\n(7) 所有 2v3 CI upper < 0.5722 < 0.60，K*=2 边界在所有 config 下清晰；\\n(8) Cross-decoding feature importance Spearman=0.87，高于 exp-003 中 Qwen 的\\n    greedy vs T=1.2 的 0.53——Pythia 架构下特征排序对解码策略更稳定。\\n\\n关键意义：这证明 decoding invariance 不是 Qwen-specific 现象，而是跨模型成立的。\\nexp-003 (Qwen) + exp-020 (Pythia) 合计 8 个 decoding configurations 全部 K*=2。\\n\"\n525\t  },\n526\t  {\n527\t    \"name\": \"Text length ablation\",\n528\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 128/256/512 tokens, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n529\t    \"results\": {\n530\t      \"k_star_all_lengths\": 2,\n531\t      \"results_by_length\": {\n532\t        \"128_tokens\": {\n533\t          \"k_star\": 2,\n534\t          \"pairwise_auc\": {\n535\t            \"0v1\": 0.9823,\n536\t            \"1v2\": 0.6187,\n537\t            \"2v3\": 0.5512,\n538\t            \"3v4\": 0.5298,\n539\t            \"4v5\": 0.5089\n540\t          },\n541\t          \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n542\t            \"1v2\": {\n543\t              \"auc\": 0.6187,\n544\t              \"ci_lower\": 0.6089,\n545\t              \"ci_upper\": 0.6285,\n546\t              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n547\t            },\n548\t            \"2v3\": {\n549\t              \"auc\": 0.5512,\n550\t              \"ci_lower\": 0.5411,\n551\t              \"ci_upper\": 0.5613,\n552\t              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n553\t            }\n554\t          },\n555\t          \"ordinal_mae\": 1.2134,\n556\t          \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.3612\n557\t        },\n558\t        \"256_tokens\": {\n559\t          \"k_star\": 2,\n560\t          \"pairwise_auc\": {\n561\t            \"0v1\": 0.9948,\n562\t            \"1v2\": 0.6347,\n563\t            \"2v3\": 0.5578,\n564\t            \"3v4\": 0.5342,\n565\t            \"4v5\": 0.5118\n566\t          },\n567\t          \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n568\t            \"1v2\": {\n569\t              \"auc\": 0.6347,\n570\t              \"ci_lower\": 0.6251,\n571\t              \"ci_upper\": 0.6443,\n572\t              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n573\t            },\n574\t            \"2v3\": {\n575\t              \"auc\": 0.5578,\n576\t              \"ci_lower\": 0.5478,\n577\t              \"ci_upper\": 0.5678,\n578\t              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n579\t            }\n580\t          },\n581\t          \"ordinal_mae\": 1.1723,\n582\t          \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.3756\n583\t        },\n584\t        \"512_tokens\": {\n585\t          \"k_star\": 2,\n586\t          \"pairwise_auc\": {\n587\t            \"0v1\": 0.9981,\n588\t            \"1v2\": 0.6523,\n589\t            \"2v3\": 0.5641,\n590\t            \"3v4\": 0.5378,\n591\t            \"4v5\": 0.5145\n592\t          },\n593\t          \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n594\t            \"1v2\": {\n595\t              \"auc\": 0.6523,\n596\t              \"ci_lower\": 0.6428,\n597\t              \"ci_upper\": 0.6618,\n598\t              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n599\t            },\n600\t            \"2v3\": {\n601\t              \"auc\": 0.5641,\n602\t              \"ci_lower\": 0.5542,\n603\t              \"ci_upper\": 0.574,\n604\t              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n605\t            }\n606\t          },\n607\t          \"ordinal_mae\": 1.1389,\n608\t          \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.3891\n609\t        }\n610\t      },\n611\t      \"auc_1v2_vs_length_spearman\": 1.0,\n612\t      \"length_effect_per_doubling\": \"+0.016 AUC per 2x tokens\"\n613\t    },\n614\t    \"tables\": [\n615\t      {\n616\t        \"title\": \"Length Ablation: K* Stability Across Text Lengths\",\n617\t        \"columns\": [\n618\t          \"length\",\n619\t          \"AUC_0v1\",\n620\t          \"AUC_1v2\",\n621\t          \"1v2_CI_lower\",\n622\t          \"AUC_2v3\",\n623\t          \"2v3_CI_upper\",\n624\t          \"K_star\"\n625\t        ],\n626\t        \"rows\": [\n627\t          [\n628\t            \"128 tokens\",\n629\t            0.9823,\n630\t            0.6187,\n631\t            0.6089,\n632\t            0.5512,\n633\t            0.5613,\n634\t            2\n635\t          ],\n636\t          [\n637\t            \"256 tokens\",\n638\t            0.9948,\n639\t            0.6347,\n640\t            0.6251,\n641\t            0.5578,\n642\t            0.5678,\n643\t            2\n644\t          ],\n645\t          [\n646\t            \"512 tokens\",\n647\t            0.9981,\n648\t            0.6523,\n649\t            0.6428,\n650\t            0.5641,\n651\t            0.574,\n652\t            2\n653\t          ]\n654\t        ]\n655\t      },\n656\t      {\n657\t        \"title\": \"Length Effect Decomposition\",\n658\t        \"columns\": [\n659\t          \"comparison\",\n660\t          \"delta_AUC_1v2\",\n661\t          \"interpretation\"\n662\t        ],\n663\t        \"rows\": [\n664\t          [\n665\t            \"128→256 (+2x)\",\n666\t            \"+0.0160\",\n667\t            \"estimation precision gain\"\n668\t          ],\n669\t          [\n670\t            \"256→512 (+2x)\",\n671\t            \"+0.0176\",\n672\t            \"consistent ~0.017/doubling\"\n673\t          ]\n674\t        ]\n675\t      }\n676\t    ],\n677\t    \"figures\": [],\n678\t    \"analysis\": \"3/3 lengths K*=2 排除了 \\\"K*=2 是长文本特有现象\\\" 的替代解释。\\n128 tokens 是实际应用中常见的短文本长度（tweets, comments, abstracts），\\nK*=2 在此条件下成立使 practical deployment 更可信。\\nAUC 的单调递增是纯统计效应（更多观测→更精确估计），\\n而非 depth signal 的质性变化——这一区分在 Discussion 中很重要，\\n因为它意味着 K* 是文本的内在属性而非测量工具的 artifact。\\n论文可写：\\\"K*=2 is invariant to text length (128–512 tokens), \\nthough detection power increases monotonically with length (~0.017 AUC per doubling).\\\"\\n\\n\\n文本长度影响特征估计的精度（样本量效应），但不影响 K* 的质性判断。预测逻辑：\\n\\n128 tokens (1v2=0.6187):\\n- 128 tokens 约 80-100 个 word-level tokens，surprisal/diversity 特征的统计估计方差增大；\\n- Qwen-cont baseline (无长度限制, 实际约 200-300 tokens) 1v2=0.6114，\\n  128 tokens 版本略高（0.6187）看似反直觉，但原因是：截短文本的前 128 tokens \\n  包含更多 prompt-influenced content，depth signal 在开头更集中；\\n- CI lower=0.6089 距 θ=0.60 仅 +0.89pp，是三个长度中最边缘的但仍然 pass；\\n- 这是整个 best tier 中最紧张的单一数据点（位于 best 档 [0.605, 0.635] 范围内）。\\n\\n256 tokens (1v2=0.6347):\\n- 统计估计更稳定，AUC 提升 ~1.6pp vs 128；\\n- CI lower=0.6251，margin 充裕（+2.5pp above θ）；\\n- 接近 Qwen-cont baseline 加上 length standardization 的增益。\\n\\n512 tokens (1v2=0.6523):\\n- 最长文本，特征估计最精确；\\n- AUC 接近 Pythia-1.4B baseline (0.6539)——同一 scorer (Qwen-1.5B) 在更长文本上\\n  能更充分表征 depth-dependent 统计偏移；\\n- CI lower=0.6428，距 θ 有 +4.3pp margin，最稳健。\\n\\n单调递增模式（128 < 256 < 512）的机理：更长文本提供更多 token-level 观测值，\\n使 15D 特征的点估计更精确、fold-level 方差更小，但所有三个长度都保持 K*=2 \\n因为 depth signal 的存在性不依赖于样本量——只是检测功效 (power) 随样本量增加。\\n关键：即使在 128 tokens 这一极短条件下，K*=2 仍然成立，\\n说明 depth signal 不是长距离相关结构的产物，而是局部统计量的根本偏移。\\n\"\n679\t  },\n680\t  {\n681\t    \"name\": \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix\",\n682\t    \"description\": \"4 generators (Qwen-cont, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-base) × 4 scorers (Qwen-1.5B, Pythia-1.4B, OLMo-1B, LLaMA-8B), 验证 scorer independence\",\n683\t    \"results\": {\n684\t      \"matrix_size\": \"4×4 = 16 cells\",\n685\t      \"k_star_2_count\": 15,\n686\t      \"k_star_2_fraction\": 0.9375,\n687\t      \"k_star_1_cells\": [\n688\t        \"OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer\"\n689\t      ],\n690\t      \"auc_1v2_matrix\": {\n691\t        \"Qwen_cont_gen\": {\n692\t          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6112,\n693\t          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6078,\n694\t          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.6034,\n695\t          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6156\n696\t        },\n697\t        \"Pythia_gen\": {\n698\t          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6539,\n699\t          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6587,\n700\t          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.6312,\n701\t          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6423\n702\t        },\n703\t        \"OLMo_gen\": {\n704\t          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6146,\n705\t          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6089,\n706\t          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.5978,\n707\t          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6067\n708\t        },\n709\t        \"Qwen_base_gen\": {\n710\t          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.626,\n711\t          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6198,\n712\t          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.6045,\n713\t          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6217\n714\t        }\n715\t      },\n716\t      \"ci_lower_matrix\": {\n717\t        \"Qwen_cont_gen\": {\n718\t          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6015,\n719\t          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.5981,\n720\t          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.5937,\n721\t          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6059\n722\t        },\n723\t        \"Pythia_gen\": {\n724\t          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6454,\n725\t          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6492,\n726\t          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.6215,\n727\t          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6328\n728\t        },\n729\t        \"OLMo_gen\": {\n730\t          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6045,\n731\t          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.5992,\n732\t          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.5881,\n733\t          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.5968\n734\t        },\n735\t        \"Qwen_base_gen\": {\n736\t          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6168,\n737\t          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6101,\n738\t          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.5948,\n739\t          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.612\n740\t        }\n741\t      },\n742\t      \"cells_below_theta\": {\n743\t        \"count\": 1,\n744\t        \"details\": \"OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer: CI lower=0.5881 < 0.60 → K*=1\"\n745\t      },\n746\t      \"scorer_effect_anova_p\": 0.23,\n747\t      \"generator_effect_anova_p\": 0.001,\n748\t      \"interaction_effect_p\": 0.41,\n749\t      \"feature_importance_cross_scorer_spearman_mean\": 0.91\n750\t    },\n751\t    \"tables\": [\n752\t      {\n753\t        \"title\": \"4×4 Cross-Scorer AUC 1v2 Matrix\",\n754\t        \"columns\": [\n755\t          \"generator↓ / scorer→\",\n756\t          \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n757\t          \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n758\t          \"OLMo-1B\",\n759\t          \"LLaMA-8B\"\n760\t        ],\n761\t        \"rows\": [\n762\t          [\n763\t            \"Qwen-cont\",\n764\t            0.6112,\n765\t            0.6078,\n766\t            0.6034,\n767\t            0.6156\n768\t          ],\n769\t          [\n770\t            \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n771\t            0.6539,\n772\t            0.6587,\n773\t            0.6312,\n774\t            0.6423\n775\t          ],\n776\t          [\n777\t            \"OLMo-1B\",\n778\t            0.6146,\n779\t            0.6089,\n780\t            \"**0.5978**\",\n781\t            0.6067\n782\t          ],\n783\t          [\n784\t            \"Qwen-base\",\n785\t            0.626,\n786\t            0.6198,\n787\t            0.6045,\n788\t            0.6217\n789\t          ]\n790\t        ]\n791\t      },\n792\t      {\n793\t        \"title\": \"ANOVA: Sources of Variation in 1v2 AUC\",\n794\t        \"columns\": [\n795\t          \"source\",\n796\t          \"F_stat\",\n797\t          \"p_value\",\n798\t          \"eta_squared\",\n799\t          \"interpretation\"\n800\t        ],\n801\t        \"rows\": [\n802\t          [\n803\t            \"generator\",\n804\t            12.7,\n805\t            0.001,\n806\t            0.68,\n807\t            \"dominant factor\"\n808\t          ],\n809\t          [\n810\t            \"scorer\",\n811\t            1.89,\n812\t            0.23,\n813\t            0.11,\n814\t            \"not significant\"\n815\t          ],\n816\t          [\n817\t            \"interaction\",\n818\t            0.73,\n819\t            0.41,\n820\t            0.04,\n821\t            \"not significant\"\n822\t          ],\n823\t          [\n824\t            \"residual\",\n825\t            \"—\",\n826\t            \"—\",\n827\t            0.17,\n828\t            \"—\"\n829\t          ]\n830\t        ]\n831\t      }\n832\t    ],\n833\t    \"figures\": [],\n834\t    \"analysis\": \"15/16 (93.75%) cells K*=2 确认 scorer independence：K* 主要由 generator 决定，\\nscorer 选择仅引入 ~1-2pp AUC 波动。\\n唯一例外 (OLMo×OLMo, K*=1) 是 weakest-signal generator + self-scorer 的 degenerate case。\\nANOVA 定量确认 generator 贡献 68% 方差 vs scorer 11%。\\n\\n对论文的影响：\\n(1) Universality claim 加强——K*=2 不仅跨 generator model 稳定，也跨 scorer model 稳定；\\n(2) Practical implication：部署时可使用任意可用 LLM 作为 scorer，无需匹配 generator；\\n(3) LLaMA-8B 作为 scorer 给出的 AUC 普遍略高于小模型 scorers（列均值 +1.3pp），\\n    提示更大的 scorer 能更精确估计 surprisal，但差异不影响 K* 判断；\\n(4) Limitation 措辞：\\\"In the degenerate case where generator and scorer coincide \\n    and the text-intrinsic signal is weakest (OLMo-1B), K* may drop to 1 due to \\n    surprisal homogenization. We recommend using a scorer ≠ generator in deployment.\\\"\\n\\n条件总数更新：\\n原 10 conditions + exp-018 (1) + exp-019 (1) + exp-020 (4) + exp-021 (3) + exp-022 中新增 conditions\\n= 10 + 2 + 4 + 3 + 考虑去重后 = 18 unique conditions (其中 17 K*=2, 1 K*=1)。\\n论文 headline: \\\"17/18 conditions K*=2 (94%), with the single exception attributable \\nto a degenerate self-scorer configuration.\\\"\\n\\nCross-scorer matrix 的核心问题：当 scorer model ≠ generator model 时，\\n15D 特征中 surprisal-based features 的计算基础改变。预测逻辑：\\n\\n整体模式——generator 效应 >> scorer 效应：\\n- ANOVA 显示 generator identity (p=0.001) 是 AUC 的主驱动因素，\\n  scorer identity (p=0.23) 不显著，交互效应 (p=0.41) 不显著；\\n- 这与 exp-013 的 \\\"depth signal ≈ 70-85% text-intrinsic\\\" 结论一致；\\n- 15D 特征中 7 个非 surprisal 特征（ttr, hapax, freq_*）完全 scorer-independent，\\n  8 个 surprisal 特征虽依赖 scorer，但跨 scorer 的相对排序高度稳定 (ρ=0.91)。\\n\\n15/16 cells K*=2 的理由：\\n- 大多数 scorer 在计算 surprisal 时提供的是\\\"另一个模型对文本难度的估计\\\"，\\n  这一估计虽然绝对值不同，但对 depth-dependent 变化的相对敏感度相似；\\n- Pythia 生成的文本在所有 4 个 scorer 下都给出最高 1v2 AUC (0.631-0.659)，\\n  因为 Pythia 的 depth signal 最强（text-intrinsic component 最大）。\\n\\n唯一 K*=1 cell (OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer, CI lower=0.5881) 的解释：\\n- OLMo 生成的文本本身 depth signal 最弱（exp-002 baseline 1v2=0.6146，所有模型中最低）；\\n- OLMo 作为 scorer 时，对自己生成的文本计算 surprisal 会产生 self-familiarity 效应，\\n  但方向相反——OLMo 对自己文本的 surprisal 更低且更均匀，\\n  反而*抹平*了 depth-dependent 的 surprisal 变化；\\n- 这与 exp_A_alt_scorer 中观察到的 cross-scorer K* 降级模式一致\\n  （olmo_qwen_cont: K*=1, AUC=0.5858），但原因不同：\\n  exp_A 中是 Qwen-cont 数据的 signal 本身弱 + cross-scorer 噪声；\\n  这里是 OLMo 数据的 signal 弱 + self-scorer 的 surprisal 均匀化效应。\\n\\nbest 档下 15/16=93.75% K*=2 的合理性：\\n- 处于 [0.85, 1.0] 范围内的上半段；\\n- 唯一失败的 cell 有清晰的机制解释，不影响 universality claim；\\n- 论文可以 frame 为 \\\"scorer independence holds except in the degenerate case \\n  where the weakest-signal generator is scored by itself.\\\"\\n\"\n835\t  }\n836\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d65558eb-e6c6-4411-977a-9f0bb2bbe358","uuid":"ebf126a6-d182-476d-a4fc-b898924c36ee","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:00:41.972Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073047/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B depth chain\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.9587,\n        \"1v2\": 0.6341,\n        \"2v3\": 0.5523,\n        \"3v4\": 0.5198,\n        \"4v5\": 0.5072\n      },\n      \"pairwise_auc_std\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.0041,\n        \"1v2\": 0.0088,\n        \"2v3\": 0.0055,\n        \"3v4\": 0.0097,\n        \"4v5\": 0.0063\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n        \"0v1\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.9587,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.9551,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.9621,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"1v2\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.6341,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.6253,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.6428,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"2v3\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5523,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5419,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5627,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"3v4\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5198,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5092,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5303,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0003\n        },\n        \"4v5\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5072,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.4968,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5178,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0891\n        }\n      },\n      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.118934,\n        \"1v2\": 0.011287,\n        \"2v3\": 0.005102,\n        \"3v4\": 0.004213,\n        \"4v5\": 0.003089\n      },\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.1982,\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.3587,\n      \"top_features\": [\n        \"freq_entropy\",\n        \"surp_d1_std\",\n        \"surp_std\",\n        \"surp_mean\",\n        \"surp_d1_skew\"\n      ],\n      \"n_samples\": 30000,\n      \"bootstrap_resamples\": 10000,\n      \"permutation_resamples\": 10000\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap 95% CI\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"depth_pair\",\n          \"AUC\",\n          \"CI_lower\",\n          \"CI_upper\",\n          \"perm_p\",\n          \"K_star_pass\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0v1\",\n            0.9587,\n            0.9551,\n            0.9621,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"✅\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1v2\",\n            0.6341,\n            0.6253,\n            0.6428,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"✅ CI_lower > 0.60\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2v3\",\n            0.5523,\n            0.5419,\n            0.5627,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"✅ CI_upper < 0.60\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3v4\",\n            0.5198,\n            0.5092,\n            0.5303,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4v5\",\n            0.5072,\n            0.4968,\n            0.5178,\n            \"0.089\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA-8B 是论文中最大模型且来自 Meta 架构族（区别于 EleutherAI/AI2/Alibaba）。\\nK*=2 在 8B 的确认将 scale coverage 从 '1B-7B' 升级为 '1B-8B'，\\narchitecture coverage 从 4 families 升级为 5 families。\\nCI lower=0.6253 提供了比 Qwen-7B (0.6079) 更充裕的 margin，\\n使得整体 universality claim 对 θ 选择更鲁棒（即使 θ 上移到 0.62，LLaMA-8B 仍然 pass）。\\nCross-tokenizer scorer 的成功也间接支持 exp-013 的 text-intrinsic signal 结论。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-3.1-8B 使用 GQA 和 RoPE，架构与 Qwen2.5 系同属 decoder-only transformer 但训练数据和 tokenizer 差异显著。\\n1v2 AUC=0.6341 处于 best 档 [0.615, 0.655] 中偏上位置，理由：\\n(1) 8B 参数量使模型能更精确地复制输入分布，gen-1 与 gen-0 的统计距离缩小，但 DPI 信息损失仍可检测；\\n(2) Cross-scorer (Qwen-1.5B) 对 LLaMA 文本计算 surprisal 时，tokenizer 不匹配引入轻微噪声，\\n    但这仅增加方差（std=0.0088）而非系统性偏差——exp-004 (Qwen-7B, 同一 scorer) 给出 0.6178，\\n    LLaMA-8B 稍高是因为 LLaMA 的 BPE 与 Qwen scorer 的 token boundary 不完全对齐，\\n    跨 tokenizer 的 surprisal 分布差异恰好放大了 depth-dependent 特征的区分度；\\n(3) 0v1 AUC=0.9587 略低于 Qwen-7B 的 0.9644，原因同上——cross-tokenizer 噪声使 binary detection 微降，\\n    但仍远高于 θ=0.60；\\n(4) 2v3 CI upper=0.5627 < 0.60，K*=2 边界清晰，不像 Qwen-cont 那样边缘；\\n(5) 4v5 pair perm_p=0.0891 > 0.05，与 exp-004 模式一致（深代际趋向随机）。\\n总结：LLaMA-8B 作为第 5 个架构族在 8B 规模确认 K*=2，CI lower=0.6253 距 θ=0.60 有 +2.5pp margin，\\n比 Qwen-cont (0.6015, +0.15pp) 稳健得多，直接强化 universality claim。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Mistral-7B depth chain\",\n    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.9612,\n        \"1v2\": 0.6278,\n        \"2v3\": 0.5489,\n        \"3v4\": 0.5167,\n        \"4v5\": 0.5054\n      },\n      \"pairwise_auc_std\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.0038,\n        \"1v2\": 0.0076,\n        \"2v3\": 0.0048,\n        \"3v4\": 0.0102,\n        \"4v5\": 0.0071\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n        \"0v1\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.9612,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.9578,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.9645,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"1v2\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.6278,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.6195,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.6362,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"2v3\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5489,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5387,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5591,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n        },\n        \"3v4\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5167,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5059,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5274,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.0008\n        },\n        \"4v5\": {\n          \"auc\": 0.5054,\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.4948,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5162,\n          \"perm_p\": 0.1243\n        }\n      },\n      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.121587,\n        \"1v2\": 0.010834,\n        \"2v3\": 0.004921,\n        \"3v4\": 0.003876,\n        \"4v5\": 0.002918\n      },\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.2078,\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.3542,\n      \"top_features\": [\n        \"surp_d1_std\",\n        \"freq_entropy\",\n        \"surp_std\",\n        \"surp_d1_mean\",\n        \"surp_skew\"\n      ],\n      \"n_samples\": 30000,\n      \"bootstrap_resamples\": 10000,\n      \"permutation_resamples\": 10000\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Mistral-7B Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap 95% CI\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"depth_pair\",\n          \"AUC\",\n          \"CI_lower\",\n          \"CI_upper\",\n          \"perm_p\",\n          \"K_star_pass\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0v1\",\n            0.9612,\n            0.9578,\n            0.9645,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"✅\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1v2\",\n            0.6278,\n            0.6195,\n            0.6362,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"✅ CI_lower > 0.60\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2v3\",\n            0.5489,\n            0.5387,\n            0.5591,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"✅ CI_upper < 0.60\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3v4\",\n            0.5167,\n            0.5059,\n            0.5274,\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4v5\",\n            0.5054,\n            0.4948,\n            0.5162,\n            \"0.124\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Mistral-7B 的 SWA 架构是唯一非 full-attention 模型。K*=2 在 SWA 下成立表明：\\ndepth signal 的退化不依赖于模型如何 attend to 长距离 context，\\n而是 iterated generation 本身对局部统计量的 lossy compression 所致。\\n这与 DPI 框架完美一致——channel 的具体实现（SWA vs full attn）不影响信息损失的定性行为。\\n结合 LLaMA-8B，两个 7-8B 模型的一致结果使 reviewer concern #1 彻底失效。\\n\\n\\nMistral-7B-v0.3 使用 sliding window attention (SWA, window=4096) + GQA，\\n与 LLaMA 的 full attention 和 Qwen 的 结构有本质差异。\\n1v2 AUC=0.6278 处于 best 档 [0.61, 0.645] 中部，略低于 LLaMA-8B (0.6341)，理由：\\n(1) Mistral 的 SWA 使长距离依赖信息在递归生成中的损失模式不同——\\n    SWA 内的局部统计特征（surprisal 局部分布）在代际间退化稍快，\\n    但全局特征（freq_entropy, ttr）退化模式与其他架构一致；\\n(2) Mistral 7B 参数量略少于 LLaMA 8B，信息保持能力的微小差异反映在 +0.63pp 的 AUC 差距；\\n(3) Cross-scorer tokenizer 效应与 LLaMA 类似但 Mistral 的 byte-fallback BPE \\n    使 surprisal 计算的 token-boundary 差异更稳定，方差略低 (std=0.0076 vs 0.0088)；\\n(4) CI lower=0.6195 距 θ=0.60 有 +1.95pp margin，稳健通过；\\n(5) 2v3 CI upper=0.5591 < 0.60，K*=2 边界明确；\\n(6) 4v5 perm_p=0.1243，深代际不可分辨，与全部先前实验一致。\\nMistral 作为第 6 个架构族（唯一的 SWA 架构），确认 K*=2 不依赖于 attention 机制选择，\\n进一步强化 \\\"architecture-invariant\\\" 叙事。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B, greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"k_star_all_configs\": true,\n      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n        \"config1_greedy\": {\n          \"0v1\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.9718,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.9691,\n              0.9744\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.6482,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.6391,\n              0.6573\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5538,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.5441,\n              0.5635\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"3v4\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5189,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.5083,\n              0.5295\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0002\n          },\n          \"4v5\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5098,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.4991,\n              0.5205\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0312\n          }\n        },\n        \"config2_nuc09\": {\n          \"0v1\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.9901,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.9886,\n              0.9916\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.6512,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.6422,\n              0.6602\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5567,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.5469,\n              0.5665\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"3v4\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5201,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.5096,\n              0.5307\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"4v5\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5112,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.5005,\n              0.5219\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0198\n          }\n        },\n        \"config3_t07\": {\n          \"0v1\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.9812,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.9789,\n              0.9835\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.6498,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.6407,\n              0.6589\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5551,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.5453,\n              0.5649\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"3v4\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5178,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.5072,\n              0.5284\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0003\n          },\n          \"4v5\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5134,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.5027,\n              0.5241\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0087\n          }\n        },\n        \"config4_t12\": {\n          \"0v1\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.9962,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.9953,\n              0.997\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"1v2\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.6671,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.6579,\n              0.6763\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"2v3\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5623,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.5524,\n              0.5722\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0\n          },\n          \"3v4\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5215,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.5108,\n              0.5322\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n          },\n          \"4v5\": {\n            \"auc\": 0.5147,\n            \"ci\": [\n              0.504,\n              0.5254\n            ],\n            \"perm_p\": 0.0052\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"auc_1v2_range\": [\n        0.6482,\n        0.6671\n      ],\n      \"auc_1v2_spread\": 0.0189,\n      \"cross_decoding_feature_spearman\": 0.87,\n      \"method\": \"GroupKFold(5) OOF + doc-level bootstrap + label permutation\",\n      \"resamples\": 10000\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Pythia-1.4B Decoding Ablation Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"decoding\",\n          \"AUC_1v2\",\n          \"CI_lower\",\n          \"CI_upper\",\n          \"AUC_2v3\",\n          \"2v3_CI_upper\",\n          \"K_star\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"greedy\",\n            0.6482,\n            0.6391,\n            0.6573,\n            0.5538,\n            0.5635,\n            2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"nucleus p=0.9\",\n            0.6512,\n            0.6422,\n            0.6602,\n            0.5567,\n            0.5665,\n            2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=0.7\",\n            0.6498,\n            0.6407,\n            0.6589,\n            0.5551,\n            0.5649,\n            2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=1.2\",\n            0.6671,\n            0.6579,\n            0.6763,\n            0.5623,\n            0.5722,\n            2\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-model Decoding Invariance Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"decoding_configs\",\n          \"1v2_range\",\n          \"range_width\",\n          \"all_K_star_2\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen-1.5B (exp-003)\",\n            4,\n            \"[0.6866, 0.7039]\",\n            0.0173,\n            \"✅\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pythia-1.4B (exp-020)\",\n            4,\n            \"[0.6482, 0.6671]\",\n            0.0189,\n            \"✅\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Pythia 4/4 decoding configs K*=2 确认 decoding invariance 是跨模型的普遍现象。\\n论文 claim 从 \\\"4 decoding strategies (single model)\\\" 升级为 \\\"8 decoding configurations across 2 models\\\"。\\nT=1.2 在两个模型上都给出最高 1v2 AUC（Qwen 0.7039, Pythia 0.6671），\\n机制一致：高温采样放大 next-token 分布的尾部，使 gen-1 的 surprisal 分布特征更显著偏离 gen-0。\\n但即便如此，2v3 仍然 < 0.60——DPI 的信息饱和在 K*=2 处仍然成立。\\nFeature importance Spearman=0.87 (cross-decoding within Pythia) 高于 0.53 (cross-decoding within Qwen, exp-003)，\\n说明 Pythia 的特征排序对解码策略更稳定，可能因为 Pythia 架构更简单（无 GQA/RoPE enhancements）。\\n\\n\\nexp-003 在 Qwen2.5-1.5B 上已证明 4/4 decoding strategies K*=2，1v2 range=[0.6866, 0.7039]。\\nPythia-1.4B 基准 1v2=0.6539 (nucleus p=0.95, exp-001)，预测 4 种解码的 1v2 range=[0.6482, 0.6671]：\\n(1) Greedy (0.6482): 确定性解码减少输出多样性，gen-1 更接近\\\"平均化\\\"的文本，\\n    相比 nucleus 0.95 的 0.6539 略低，因为 greedy 的低熵输出使 surprisal 方差特征的区分度微降；\\n(2) Nucleus p=0.9 (0.6512): 接近 baseline 的 p=0.95，差异极小；\\n(3) T=0.7 (0.6498): 低温采样与 greedy 类似，轻微压缩分布尾部；\\n(4) T=1.2 (0.6671): 高温增加输出多样性，gen-1 文本的统计特征偏离更明显，\\n    1v2 区分度升高——与 exp-003 中 T=1.2 给出最高 AUC (0.7039) 的模式完全一致；\\n(5) Range=0.0189 << Qwen 的 0.0173，说明 Pythia 对解码策略的敏感度与 Qwen 量级相当；\\n(6) 所有 4 个 config 的 CI lower 均 > 0.639，远高于 θ=0.60，margin 充裕；\\n(7) 所有 2v3 CI upper < 0.5722 < 0.60，K*=2 边界在所有 config 下清晰；\\n(8) Cross-decoding feature importance Spearman=0.87，高于 exp-003 中 Qwen 的\\n    greedy vs T=1.2 的 0.53——Pythia 架构下特征排序对解码策略更稳定。\\n\\n关键意义：这证明 decoding invariance 不是 Qwen-specific 现象，而是跨模型成立的。\\nexp-003 (Qwen) + exp-020 (Pythia) 合计 8 个 decoding configurations 全部 K*=2。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Text length ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 128/256/512 tokens, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star_all_lengths\": 2,\n      \"results_by_length\": {\n        \"128_tokens\": {\n          \"k_star\": 2,\n          \"pairwise_auc\": {\n            \"0v1\": 0.9823,\n            \"1v2\": 0.6187,\n            \"2v3\": 0.5512,\n            \"3v4\": 0.5298,\n            \"4v5\": 0.5089\n          },\n          \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n            \"1v2\": {\n              \"auc\": 0.6187,\n              \"ci_lower\": 0.6089,\n              \"ci_upper\": 0.6285,\n              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n            },\n            \"2v3\": {\n              \"auc\": 0.5512,\n              \"ci_lower\": 0.5411,\n              \"ci_upper\": 0.5613,\n              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n            }\n          },\n          \"ordinal_mae\": 1.2134,\n          \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.3612\n        },\n        \"256_tokens\": {\n          \"k_star\": 2,\n          \"pairwise_auc\": {\n            \"0v1\": 0.9948,\n            \"1v2\": 0.6347,\n            \"2v3\": 0.5578,\n            \"3v4\": 0.5342,\n            \"4v5\": 0.5118\n          },\n          \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n            \"1v2\": {\n              \"auc\": 0.6347,\n              \"ci_lower\": 0.6251,\n              \"ci_upper\": 0.6443,\n              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n            },\n            \"2v3\": {\n              \"auc\": 0.5578,\n              \"ci_lower\": 0.5478,\n              \"ci_upper\": 0.5678,\n              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n            }\n          },\n          \"ordinal_mae\": 1.1723,\n          \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.3756\n        },\n        \"512_tokens\": {\n          \"k_star\": 2,\n          \"pairwise_auc\": {\n            \"0v1\": 0.9981,\n            \"1v2\": 0.6523,\n            \"2v3\": 0.5641,\n            \"3v4\": 0.5378,\n            \"4v5\": 0.5145\n          },\n          \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n            \"1v2\": {\n              \"auc\": 0.6523,\n              \"ci_lower\": 0.6428,\n              \"ci_upper\": 0.6618,\n              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n            },\n            \"2v3\": {\n              \"auc\": 0.5641,\n              \"ci_lower\": 0.5542,\n              \"ci_upper\": 0.574,\n              \"perm_p\": 0.0001\n            }\n          },\n          \"ordinal_mae\": 1.1389,\n          \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.3891\n        }\n      },\n      \"auc_1v2_vs_length_spearman\": 1.0,\n      \"length_effect_per_doubling\": \"+0.016 AUC per 2x tokens\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Length Ablation: K* Stability Across Text Lengths\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"length\",\n          \"AUC_0v1\",\n          \"AUC_1v2\",\n          \"1v2_CI_lower\",\n          \"AUC_2v3\",\n          \"2v3_CI_upper\",\n          \"K_star\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"128 tokens\",\n            0.9823,\n            0.6187,\n            0.6089,\n            0.5512,\n            0.5613,\n            2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"256 tokens\",\n            0.9948,\n            0.6347,\n            0.6251,\n            0.5578,\n            0.5678,\n            2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"512 tokens\",\n            0.9981,\n            0.6523,\n            0.6428,\n            0.5641,\n            0.574,\n            2\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Length Effect Decomposition\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"comparison\",\n          \"delta_AUC_1v2\",\n          \"interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"128→256 (+2x)\",\n            \"+0.0160\",\n            \"estimation precision gain\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"256→512 (+2x)\",\n            \"+0.0176\",\n            \"consistent ~0.017/doubling\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"3/3 lengths K*=2 排除了 \\\"K*=2 是长文本特有现象\\\" 的替代解释。\\n128 tokens 是实际应用中常见的短文本长度（tweets, comments, abstracts），\\nK*=2 在此条件下成立使 practical deployment 更可信。\\nAUC 的单调递增是纯统计效应（更多观测→更精确估计），\\n而非 depth signal 的质性变化——这一区分在 Discussion 中很重要，\\n因为它意味着 K* 是文本的内在属性而非测量工具的 artifact。\\n论文可写：\\\"K*=2 is invariant to text length (128–512 tokens), \\nthough detection power increases monotonically with length (~0.017 AUC per doubling).\\\"\\n\\n\\n文本长度影响特征估计的精度（样本量效应），但不影响 K* 的质性判断。预测逻辑：\\n\\n128 tokens (1v2=0.6187):\\n- 128 tokens 约 80-100 个 word-level tokens，surprisal/diversity 特征的统计估计方差增大；\\n- Qwen-cont baseline (无长度限制, 实际约 200-300 tokens) 1v2=0.6114，\\n  128 tokens 版本略高（0.6187）看似反直觉，但原因是：截短文本的前 128 tokens \\n  包含更多 prompt-influenced content，depth signal 在开头更集中；\\n- CI lower=0.6089 距 θ=0.60 仅 +0.89pp，是三个长度中最边缘的但仍然 pass；\\n- 这是整个 best tier 中最紧张的单一数据点（位于 best 档 [0.605, 0.635] 范围内）。\\n\\n256 tokens (1v2=0.6347):\\n- 统计估计更稳定，AUC 提升 ~1.6pp vs 128；\\n- CI lower=0.6251，margin 充裕（+2.5pp above θ）；\\n- 接近 Qwen-cont baseline 加上 length standardization 的增益。\\n\\n512 tokens (1v2=0.6523):\\n- 最长文本，特征估计最精确；\\n- AUC 接近 Pythia-1.4B baseline (0.6539)——同一 scorer (Qwen-1.5B) 在更长文本上\\n  能更充分表征 depth-dependent 统计偏移；\\n- CI lower=0.6428，距 θ 有 +4.3pp margin，最稳健。\\n\\n单调递增模式（128 < 256 < 512）的机理：更长文本提供更多 token-level 观测值，\\n使 15D 特征的点估计更精确、fold-level 方差更小，但所有三个长度都保持 K*=2 \\n因为 depth signal 的存在性不依赖于样本量——只是检测功效 (power) 随样本量增加。\\n关键：即使在 128 tokens 这一极短条件下，K*=2 仍然成立，\\n说明 depth signal 不是长距离相关结构的产物，而是局部统计量的根本偏移。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix\",\n    \"description\": \"4 generators (Qwen-cont, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-base) × 4 scorers (Qwen-1.5B, Pythia-1.4B, OLMo-1B, LLaMA-8B), 验证 scorer independence\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"matrix_size\": \"4×4 = 16 cells\",\n      \"k_star_2_count\": 15,\n      \"k_star_2_fraction\": 0.9375,\n      \"k_star_1_cells\": [\n        \"OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer\"\n      ],\n      \"auc_1v2_matrix\": {\n        \"Qwen_cont_gen\": {\n          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6112,\n          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6078,\n          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.6034,\n          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6156\n        },\n        \"Pythia_gen\": {\n          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6539,\n          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6587,\n          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.6312,\n          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6423\n        },\n        \"OLMo_gen\": {\n          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6146,\n          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6089,\n          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.5978,\n          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6067\n        },\n        \"Qwen_base_gen\": {\n          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.626,\n          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6198,\n          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.6045,\n          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6217\n        }\n      },\n      \"ci_lower_matrix\": {\n        \"Qwen_cont_gen\": {\n          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6015,\n          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.5981,\n          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.5937,\n          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6059\n        },\n        \"Pythia_gen\": {\n          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6454,\n          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6492,\n          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.6215,\n          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.6328\n        },\n        \"OLMo_gen\": {\n          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6045,\n          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.5992,\n          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.5881,\n          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.5968\n        },\n        \"Qwen_base_gen\": {\n          \"Qwen_scorer\": 0.6168,\n          \"Pythia_scorer\": 0.6101,\n          \"OLMo_scorer\": 0.5948,\n          \"LLaMA_scorer\": 0.612\n        }\n      },\n      \"cells_below_theta\": {\n        \"count\": 1,\n        \"details\": \"OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer: CI lower=0.5881 < 0.60 → K*=1\"\n      },\n      \"scorer_effect_anova_p\": 0.23,\n      \"generator_effect_anova_p\": 0.001,\n      \"interaction_effect_p\": 0.41,\n      \"feature_importance_cross_scorer_spearman_mean\": 0.91\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"4×4 Cross-Scorer AUC 1v2 Matrix\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"generator↓ / scorer→\",\n          \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n          \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n          \"OLMo-1B\",\n          \"LLaMA-8B\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen-cont\",\n            0.6112,\n            0.6078,\n            0.6034,\n            0.6156\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n            0.6539,\n            0.6587,\n            0.6312,\n            0.6423\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-1B\",\n            0.6146,\n            0.6089,\n            \"**0.5978**\",\n            0.6067\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-base\",\n            0.626,\n            0.6198,\n            0.6045,\n            0.6217\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"ANOVA: Sources of Variation in 1v2 AUC\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"source\",\n          \"F_stat\",\n          \"p_value\",\n          \"eta_squared\",\n          \"interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"generator\",\n            12.7,\n            0.001,\n            0.68,\n            \"dominant factor\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"scorer\",\n            1.89,\n            0.23,\n            0.11,\n            \"not significant\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"interaction\",\n            0.73,\n            0.41,\n            0.04,\n            \"not significant\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"residual\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            0.17,\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"15/16 (93.75%) cells K*=2 确认 scorer independence：K* 主要由 generator 决定，\\nscorer 选择仅引入 ~1-2pp AUC 波动。\\n唯一例外 (OLMo×OLMo, K*=1) 是 weakest-signal generator + self-scorer 的 degenerate case。\\nANOVA 定量确认 generator 贡献 68% 方差 vs scorer 11%。\\n\\n对论文的影响：\\n(1) Universality claim 加强——K*=2 不仅跨 generator model 稳定，也跨 scorer model 稳定；\\n(2) Practical implication：部署时可使用任意可用 LLM 作为 scorer，无需匹配 generator；\\n(3) LLaMA-8B 作为 scorer 给出的 AUC 普遍略高于小模型 scorers（列均值 +1.3pp），\\n    提示更大的 scorer 能更精确估计 surprisal，但差异不影响 K* 判断；\\n(4) Limitation 措辞：\\\"In the degenerate case where generator and scorer coincide \\n    and the text-intrinsic signal is weakest (OLMo-1B), K* may drop to 1 due to \\n    surprisal homogenization. We recommend using a scorer ≠ generator in deployment.\\\"\\n\\n条件总数更新：\\n原 10 conditions + exp-018 (1) + exp-019 (1) + exp-020 (4) + exp-021 (3) + exp-022 中新增 conditions\\n= 10 + 2 + 4 + 3 + 考虑去重后 = 18 unique conditions (其中 17 K*=2, 1 K*=1)。\\n论文 headline: \\\"17/18 conditions K*=2 (94%), with the single exception attributable \\nto a degenerate self-scorer configuration.\\\"\\n\\nCross-scorer matrix 的核心问题：当 scorer model ≠ generator model 时，\\n15D 特征中 surprisal-based features 的计算基础改变。预测逻辑：\\n\\n整体模式——generator 效应 >> scorer 效应：\\n- ANOVA 显示 generator identity (p=0.001) 是 AUC 的主驱动因素，\\n  scorer identity (p=0.23) 不显著，交互效应 (p=0.41) 不显著；\\n- 这与 exp-013 的 \\\"depth signal ≈ 70-85% text-intrinsic\\\" 结论一致；\\n- 15D 特征中 7 个非 surprisal 特征（ttr, hapax, freq_*）完全 scorer-independent，\\n  8 个 surprisal 特征虽依赖 scorer，但跨 scorer 的相对排序高度稳定 (ρ=0.91)。\\n\\n15/16 cells K*=2 的理由：\\n- 大多数 scorer 在计算 surprisal 时提供的是\\\"另一个模型对文本难度的估计\\\"，\\n  这一估计虽然绝对值不同，但对 depth-dependent 变化的相对敏感度相似；\\n- Pythia 生成的文本在所有 4 个 scorer 下都给出最高 1v2 AUC (0.631-0.659)，\\n  因为 Pythia 的 depth signal 最强（text-intrinsic component 最大）。\\n\\n唯一 K*=1 cell (OLMo_gen × OLMo_scorer, CI lower=0.5881) 的解释：\\n- OLMo 生成的文本本身 depth signal 最弱（exp-002 baseline 1v2=0.6146，所有模型中最低）；\\n- OLMo 作为 scorer 时，对自己生成的文本计算 surprisal 会产生 self-familiarity 效应，\\n  但方向相反——OLMo 对自己文本的 surprisal 更低且更均匀，\\n  反而*抹平*了 depth-dependent 的 surprisal 变化；\\n- 这与 exp_A_alt_scorer 中观察到的 cross-scorer K* 降级模式一致\\n  （olmo_qwen_cont: K*=1, AUC=0.5858），但原因不同：\\n  exp_A 中是 Qwen-cont 数据的 signal 本身弱 + cross-scorer 噪声；\\n  这里是 OLMo 数据的 signal 弱 + self-scorer 的 surprisal 均匀化效应。\\n\\nbest 档下 15/16=93.75% K*=2 的合理性：\\n- 处于 [0.85, 1.0] 范围内的上半段；\\n- 唯一失败的 cell 有清晰的机制解释，不影响 universality claim；\\n- 论文可以 frame 为 \\\"scorer independence holds except in the degenerate case \\n  where the weakest-signal generator is scored by itself.\\\"\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":836,"startLine":1,"totalLines":836}}}
