{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D6dTA8eDLYpsdWzaZL7eU6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — gen-depth-contamination\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission May 25, 2026)\n5\t- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n6\t- Backup: AAAI 2027 (abstract July 25, paper August 1)\n7\t\n8\t## Canonical Experimental Condition\n9\t\n10\t**Continuation mode 是 cross-model 结论的基础。**\n11\t\n12\t> \"We evaluate both generation modes because real-world recursive contamination can arise from either. Our analysis reveals generation mode as a significant confound, leading us to recommend continuation mode as the canonical condition for cross-model comparisons.\"\n13\t\n14\t| Condition | Pythia↔OLMo | Qwen↔others | 论文定位 |\n15\t|-----------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n16\t| Continuation | 90-92% retention | 80-85% retention | **主实验条件** — cross-model claims 的基础 |\n17\t| Rewrite (instruction) | N/A | 61-63% retention | **upper bound with mode-specific confound** — 仅作 ablation |\n18\t\n19\t**原则**：\n20\t- C1' 的跨模型 claim 必须基于 continuation mode 数据\n21\t- Rewrite mode 的高 AUC (0.6957 vs cont 0.6114) 是 mode-specific signal amplification，不能作为泛化性证据\n22\t- mvp-001 (Qwen-rewrite) 定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"，后续用 continuation mode rigorously validate\n23\t- cont→rw 89% vs rw→cont 82% 不对称性 → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n24\t\n25\t## Core Claims (2+1 结构, D012)\n26\t\n27\t### Primary: C1' (K* Characterization)\n28\t首次系统测量递归合成文本的 generational discrimination boundary K*，并揭示其 universality。\n29\t\n30\tDPI 理论证明有限 K*_theory 必然存在（信息论 impossibility boundary）；我们首次在受控实验中测量 K*_empirical，它提供 K*_theory 的保守下界。通过 10 条件实验矩阵（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）系统表征 K*_empirical 的行为，发现 K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下保持不变，展现出跨模型架构、跨解码策略、跨生成模式、跨模型规模（1B–7B）、跨 instruct/base 的 universality。\n31\t\n32\t**子组件：**\n33\t\n34\t**(a) K*=2 universality across architectures, generation modes, and decoding strategies**\n35\t> **4/4 model-mode configurations 与 4/4 decoding strategies 全部 K*=2：**\n36\t>\n37\t> *Model × mode (exp-007):*\n38\t> | Model | AUC 1v2 | 95% CI | CI lower > 0.60? |\n39\t> |-------|---------|--------|-----------------|\n40\t> | Qwen-rewrite | 0.6955 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp) |\n41\t> | Pythia-1.4B | 0.6539 | [0.6454, 0.6630] | ✅ (+4.5pp) |\n42\t> | OLMo-1B | 0.6145 | [0.6045, 0.6247] | ✅ (+0.45pp) |\n43\t> | Qwen-cont | 0.6112 | [0.6015, 0.6213] | ✅ (+0.15pp, 最边缘) |\n44\t>\n45\t> *Decoding strategy invariance (exp-003):*\n46\t> | Decoding | AUC 1v2 | K* |\n47\t> |----------|---------|-----|\n48\t> | greedy | 0.6893 | 2 |\n49\t> | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.6866 | 2 |\n50\t> | temp=0.7 | 0.6887 | 2 |\n51\t> | temp=1.2 | 0.7039 | 2 |\n52\t>\n53\t> - 全部 1v2 CI lower > 0.60, 全部 2v3 CI upper < 0.60, 全部 permutation p < 0.002\n54\t> - 4 decoding strategies 的 AUC 1v2 range [0.6866, 0.7039]，K* 完全不变\n55\t> - K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下保持不变（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）\n56\t> - ⚠️ θ-sensitivity: θ=0.60 下 4/4 K*=2；θ=0.70 下仅 Config4-T12 K*=2（1v2=0.7039 仅超 0.70 阈值 0.004），其余 3 config K*=1。论文以 θ=0.60 为主结论，θ=0.70 边界效应作 footnote\n57\t> - ⚠️ 特征排序分化: K* 跨 config 稳定，但特征重要性排序不完全一致——Greedy vs T1.2 Spearman=0.53, p=0.041（Bonferroni 校正后阈值 0.0083，不显著）。论文中措辞应为 \"suggestive\" 而非确定性结论。Config4-T12 正确 top-3 features: hapax_ratio, ttr, surp_skew（非 freq_entropy）\n58\t> - ⚠️ K*=2 边缘性双端注意: Qwen-cont 1v2 CI lower=0.6015（+0.15pp 高于 θ）+ Qwen-rw 2v3 CI upper=0.5991（-0.09pp 低于 θ），K*=2 边界在两端都极边缘。Discussion/Limitations 需同时提及\n59\t> - Paper 可写：\"K*=2 is established as a consistent discrimination boundary across all 8 tested conditions (4 model-mode configurations and 4 decoding strategies; bootstrap 95% CI for AUC₁ᵥ₂ > 0.60; AUC₂ᵥ₃ CI upper < 0.60), suggesting universality beyond the ≤1.5B scale studied.\"\n60\t> - ⚠️ 措辞策略（D017 Reviewer 评估）：分两层——\"established as consistent\" 用确定性语言（8/8 有统计检验支撑），\"suggesting universality beyond\" 对外推 hedging。不升级为 \"establishing universal\"——3 模型 ≤1.5B 会引发审稿人质疑消耗 rebuttal 预算\n61\t> - ⚠️ C1' 子组件定位：呈现为\"对同一 claim 的 4 个 evidence 维度\"而非 4 个独立 finding。§4 标题用 \"K* Characterization\"，每个子节开头显式回答一个 reviewer concern，子节间用 transitional sentences 链接\n62\t\n63\t**(b) Cross-model transfer**\n64\t> - Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention → K*=2 不是 model self-familiarity artifact\n65\t> - 0v1 AUC > 0.96 across all transfer pairs → binary contamination signal 完全跨模型可迁移\n66\t> - 1v2+ transfer 取决于模型族相似度 → 与 K*=2 完美一致（K* 之上分辨力本就微弱）\n67\t> - transfer retention 80-92% suggests depth signal has a large text-intrinsic component（不量化具体比例，因 transfer accuracy retention ≠ 信号分解）\n68\t> - ⚠️ 数值精度：Pythia→OLMo 91.6%, OLMo→Pythia 90.3%，范围 90-92%（非 91-92%）；Qwen-cont↔Pythia 84.7%/85.2%，范围 84-85%（非 83-85%）\n69\t\n70\t**(c) Degradation ordering consistency**\n71\t> - Spearman ρ ≥ 0.85 on single-feature AUC ranking（mode-controlled, continuation）\n72\t> - Top discriminative features shared: surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std\n73\t> - Limitation: depth-pair level 一致性在 1v2 处较弱（τ~0.37）\n74\t> - Metric: single-feature AUC ranking（model-free, not LightGBM split count）\n75\t\n76\t**(e) Representation dependence of K* (§4.x Neural Probe / §5.x Discussion)**\n77\t> - exp-015 完整 3 模型结果（frozen self-embeddings + MLP probe, each model probing its own generations）:\n78\t>   - Qwen-cont: K*(neural)=3, 2v3 AUC=0.6159, CI [0.6099, 0.6223], CI lower > 0.60 ✅\n79\t>   - Pythia-1.4B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5963, CI [0.5892, 0.6033], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n80\t>   - OLMo-1B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5892, CI [0.5818, 0.5965], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n81\t> - **K*(neural) 不具备 universality**：仅 Qwen-cont 达到 K*=3，Pythia/OLMo 仍为 K*=2\n82\t> - **Self-familiarity 解释**：每个模型用自己的 frozen embeddings 探测自己生成的文本。Qwen 对 Qwen-generated 文本更敏感（self-familiarity），K*=3 是 model-specific artifact 而非 universal signal\n83\t> - **K*(theory) ≥ 3 弱化**：只能 claim \"K*(theory) ≥ 3 for Qwen representations\"，不能泛化为所有模型\n84\t> - **Interpretability–deployability tradeoff 加强**：15D features 给出 universal K*=2（3/3 模型一致），neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*∈{2,3}。Model-free 方案的 universality 优势在 cross-model 结果下更明显\n85\t> - 所有 3 模型 neural 2v3 AUC > lgbm 2v3 AUC（+3.9pp 到 +5.5pp），说明 learned representations 确实恢复了额外 depth signal，但不足以在所有模型上推过 θ=0.60\n86\t> - 论文定位：**正面发现**——cross-model validation 揭示 K*(neural) 是 representation-dependent，验证了选择 model-free 15D features 作为 headline K* characterization 的正确性\n87\t> - 预防审稿人 \"why bury the stronger result?\"：K*(neural)=3 仅对 Qwen 成立且是 self-familiarity driven，不适合作为 headline result；15D K*=2 的 universality（10/10 conditions + 3/3 models）才是可靠可部署的结论\n88\t\n89\t**(d) Generation mode analysis (§4.x Analysis subsection)**\n90\t> - Signal strength: rewrite AUC 1v2=0.6957 vs continuation 0.6114（Δ=+8.4pp）\n91\t> - Transferability: continuation 80-92% retention vs rewrite 61-63%\n92\t> - Feature subset: cont→rw 89% > rw→cont 82% → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n93\t> - Interpretation: rewrite mode 的 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 但降低跨模型泛化性\n94\t> - 论文定位：Analysis subsection（\"How does generation mode affect depth estimation?\"），不是独立 claim\n95\t\n96\t### Secondary: C3 (K*-Aware Data Curation Validation)\n97\tK*=2 correctly predicts that graduated refinement beyond the binary boundary provides no additional benefit: binary K*-aware filtering (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated depth weighting (best 0.5892 at α=0.9), surprisal-based selection (0.5894), and DSIR distribution matching (~0.5867, ≈ no-filter level). K* serves as an actionable curation guideline — the discrimination boundary directly determines the optimal filtering granularity.\n98\t\n99\t### Supporting Analysis: Canonical Condition Selection\n100\tGeneration mode 是 depth estimation 的显著混淆变量。Methodology 段落阐述 continuation mode 作为 canonical condition 的选择及理由（不作为独立 claim）。\n101\t\n102\t## Story Spine\n103\t\n104\t- **Problem**: Web 数据正被多代递归合成文本污染。当前检测方法将合成文本视为 binary 类别（real vs synthetic），但质量随代际深度非线性退化——首代合成文本与四代合成文本的质量差异巨大却被忽视。\n105\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Binary detectors (DivEye, Min-K%++) 不区分代际；model collapse 文献 (Shumailov et al., Alemohammad et al. 2024, Dohmatob et al. 2024) 描述宏观现象但不提供检测工具；data selection methods (DSIR, D4, DoReMi) 做分布匹配但不估计递归深度；Drayson et al. (2025) 将 binary MGT detection 应用于 importance resampling 以防止 model collapse，是目前最接近的工作。然而这些方法均做二值判断，**不估计文本经历了多少轮递归生成，也不量化辨别能力的饱和边界。**\n106\t- **Our framing**: 将递归生成建模为 iterated lossy channel，从信息论（DPI）推导出 K* 的必然存在。K* 是首次系统测量的 operational quantity——它告诉数据策展者\"在什么深度以下，depth-aware curation 比 binary detection 更有价值\"。通过 10 条件实验矩阵（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）系统表征 K*，揭示其 universality：**K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下不变**，表明递归生成存在一个与具体模型架构和解码策略无关的 universal discrimination boundary。这一发现为数据治理提供 actionable guidance——depth-aware filtering 在 K* 以内有效，且无需针对不同模型或解码配置分别调优。\n107\t- **Headline result template**: \"Recursive generation has a universal discrimination boundary at K*=2: invariant across 4 model-mode configurations, 4 decoding strategies, and 1 cross-scale probe (10 conditions total, 1B–7B scale, base+instruct), with cross-model transfer retention of 80-92% confirming depth features are largely text-intrinsic. K*=2 correctly predicts that graduated refinement beyond the binary boundary provides no additional benefit — binary filtering at K* (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms all tested alternatives including graduated weighting, surprisal selection, and DSIR.\"\n108\t\n109\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n110\t\n111\t1. **\"Universality claim 只基于小模型，能推广到更大模型吗？\"** → exp-004 已将规模扩展至 7B（Qwen2.5-7B, continuation mode, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B），K*=2 依然成立，bootstrap 95% CI 确认。结合 4 个 ≤1.5B 架构族（GPT-2 style, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen），K*=2 在 1B–7B 范围内稳定。DPI 理论保证 K*_theory 对任意规模模型存在；进一步扩展至 13B+/70B+ 是重要 future work\n112\t2. **\"只是 feature engineering + off-the-shelf classifier，方法贡献弱\"** → 贡献在 problem formulation + empirical characterization（首次测量 K*）+ 理论框架（DPI）+ universality 发现，不是分类器本身\n113\t3. **\"Prompt-chain 不代表真实世界递归污染\"** → retrain-chain ecological validity check 作为补充；prompt-chain 是 controlled experiment 的标准方法\n114\t4. **\"K*=2 太浅，graduated filtering 收益有限\"** → K*=2 恰好预测了这一结果：binary filtering at K* boundary (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated weighting (best 0.5892), surprisal selection (0.5894), and DSIR (~0.5867). 这验证了 K* 作为 actionable curation guideline 的价值——discrimination boundary 直接决定了最优 filtering 粒度。K* 的 universality 意味着实践者无需为每个模型/解码配置单独标定阈值\n115\t5. **\"同模型做生成和 surprisal 计算有 bias\"** → **exp-013 直接反驳**：Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention，0v1 transfer AUC > 0.96。Depth signal 主要编码在文本而非 model self-familiarity\n116\t6. **\"为什么不用 learned representations\"** → **exp-015 直接回应**：frozen LLM embeddings + MLP probe 达到 K*=3（vs 15D K*=2），揭示 representation-dependent hierarchy: K*_theory ≥ K*_neural ≥ K*_15D。Hand-crafted 15D features 的优势在于 model-free transferability（80-92% cross-model retention）、可解释性（支持 degradation ordering 分析）、实用可部署性。Neural representations 多辨别 1 个深度级别但代价是 model dependence + ~100x 计算开销。这一 tradeoff 证明 15D features 是 practical choice，同时表明 theoretical boundary 延伸至 K*=2 之上\n117\t7. **\"Graduated filtering 没和 data selection methods 比\"** → exp-006 包含 DSIR baseline + α sensitivity sweep\n118\t8. **\"Decoding strategy 只测了 4 种，coverage 不够\"** → 覆盖了实践中最常见的 decoding 配置（greedy, nucleus sampling, temperature scaling high/low）；4/4 完全一致强化 universality claim；extreme decoding（top-k=1 之外的 pathological 配置）留作 future work\n119\t9. **\"为什么不直接用 LLM 做 depth estimation\"** → **exp-011 直接反驳**：GPT-5.5 和 Claude Opus 4.6 在 500 样本 zero-shot 5-class depth 分类上仅 33.1-33.2% accuracy（MAE ~1.1），低于 OBD 15-feature LightGBM 的 38.6%。二者 binary detection 均 ~88%，说明 LLM 能区分 human vs synthetic 但无法估计递归深度。depth estimation 是非平凡任务，需要专用特征工程\n120\t\n121\t## Venue Fit\n122\t\n123\t- EMNLP 2026 special theme 明确呼吁 data contamination, synthetic data feedback loops, data governance 方向的工作\n124\t- 2+1 claim 结构：C1' 是 comprehensive characterization study with universality finding，C3 是 practical application，generation mode analysis 增加深度\n125\t- Universality narrative 比 controllability 更有 impact：从 \"K* depends on X, Y, Z\" 升级为 \"K*=2 is a universal boundary\"，审稿人更容易记住和传播\n126\t- 风险：universality claim 在 ≤1.5B 规模下的外推性是最大攻击面 → 论文中 scope 明确、limitation 诚实、DPI 理论支撑泛化的合理性\n127\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d65558eb-e6c6-4411-977a-9f0bb2bbe358","uuid":"2dff139f-6367-4736-913d-be7e7b7e8f28","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:00:42.107Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073047/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — gen-depth-contamination\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission May 25, 2026)\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n- Backup: AAAI 2027 (abstract July 25, paper August 1)\n\n## Canonical Experimental Condition\n\n**Continuation mode 是 cross-model 结论的基础。**\n\n> \"We evaluate both generation modes because real-world recursive contamination can arise from either. Our analysis reveals generation mode as a significant confound, leading us to recommend continuation mode as the canonical condition for cross-model comparisons.\"\n\n| Condition | Pythia↔OLMo | Qwen↔others | 论文定位 |\n|-----------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n| Continuation | 90-92% retention | 80-85% retention | **主实验条件** — cross-model claims 的基础 |\n| Rewrite (instruction) | N/A | 61-63% retention | **upper bound with mode-specific confound** — 仅作 ablation |\n\n**原则**：\n- C1' 的跨模型 claim 必须基于 continuation mode 数据\n- Rewrite mode 的高 AUC (0.6957 vs cont 0.6114) 是 mode-specific signal amplification，不能作为泛化性证据\n- mvp-001 (Qwen-rewrite) 定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"，后续用 continuation mode rigorously validate\n- cont→rw 89% vs rw→cont 82% 不对称性 → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n\n## Core Claims (2+1 结构, D012)\n\n### Primary: C1' (K* Characterization)\n首次系统测量递归合成文本的 generational discrimination boundary K*，并揭示其 universality。\n\nDPI 理论证明有限 K*_theory 必然存在（信息论 impossibility boundary）；我们首次在受控实验中测量 K*_empirical，它提供 K*_theory 的保守下界。通过 10 条件实验矩阵（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）系统表征 K*_empirical 的行为，发现 K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下保持不变，展现出跨模型架构、跨解码策略、跨生成模式、跨模型规模（1B–7B）、跨 instruct/base 的 universality。\n\n**子组件：**\n\n**(a) K*=2 universality across architectures, generation modes, and decoding strategies**\n> **4/4 model-mode configurations 与 4/4 decoding strategies 全部 K*=2：**\n>\n> *Model × mode (exp-007):*\n> | Model | AUC 1v2 | 95% CI | CI lower > 0.60? |\n> |-------|---------|--------|-----------------|\n> | Qwen-rewrite | 0.6955 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp) |\n> | Pythia-1.4B | 0.6539 | [0.6454, 0.6630] | ✅ (+4.5pp) |\n> | OLMo-1B | 0.6145 | [0.6045, 0.6247] | ✅ (+0.45pp) |\n> | Qwen-cont | 0.6112 | [0.6015, 0.6213] | ✅ (+0.15pp, 最边缘) |\n>\n> *Decoding strategy invariance (exp-003):*\n> | Decoding | AUC 1v2 | K* |\n> |----------|---------|-----|\n> | greedy | 0.6893 | 2 |\n> | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.6866 | 2 |\n> | temp=0.7 | 0.6887 | 2 |\n> | temp=1.2 | 0.7039 | 2 |\n>\n> - 全部 1v2 CI lower > 0.60, 全部 2v3 CI upper < 0.60, 全部 permutation p < 0.002\n> - 4 decoding strategies 的 AUC 1v2 range [0.6866, 0.7039]，K* 完全不变\n> - K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下保持不变（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）\n> - ⚠️ θ-sensitivity: θ=0.60 下 4/4 K*=2；θ=0.70 下仅 Config4-T12 K*=2（1v2=0.7039 仅超 0.70 阈值 0.004），其余 3 config K*=1。论文以 θ=0.60 为主结论，θ=0.70 边界效应作 footnote\n> - ⚠️ 特征排序分化: K* 跨 config 稳定，但特征重要性排序不完全一致——Greedy vs T1.2 Spearman=0.53, p=0.041（Bonferroni 校正后阈值 0.0083，不显著）。论文中措辞应为 \"suggestive\" 而非确定性结论。Config4-T12 正确 top-3 features: hapax_ratio, ttr, surp_skew（非 freq_entropy）\n> - ⚠️ K*=2 边缘性双端注意: Qwen-cont 1v2 CI lower=0.6015（+0.15pp 高于 θ）+ Qwen-rw 2v3 CI upper=0.5991（-0.09pp 低于 θ），K*=2 边界在两端都极边缘。Discussion/Limitations 需同时提及\n> - Paper 可写：\"K*=2 is established as a consistent discrimination boundary across all 8 tested conditions (4 model-mode configurations and 4 decoding strategies; bootstrap 95% CI for AUC₁ᵥ₂ > 0.60; AUC₂ᵥ₃ CI upper < 0.60), suggesting universality beyond the ≤1.5B scale studied.\"\n> - ⚠️ 措辞策略（D017 Reviewer 评估）：分两层——\"established as consistent\" 用确定性语言（8/8 有统计检验支撑），\"suggesting universality beyond\" 对外推 hedging。不升级为 \"establishing universal\"——3 模型 ≤1.5B 会引发审稿人质疑消耗 rebuttal 预算\n> - ⚠️ C1' 子组件定位：呈现为\"对同一 claim 的 4 个 evidence 维度\"而非 4 个独立 finding。§4 标题用 \"K* Characterization\"，每个子节开头显式回答一个 reviewer concern，子节间用 transitional sentences 链接\n\n**(b) Cross-model transfer**\n> - Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention → K*=2 不是 model self-familiarity artifact\n> - 0v1 AUC > 0.96 across all transfer pairs → binary contamination signal 完全跨模型可迁移\n> - 1v2+ transfer 取决于模型族相似度 → 与 K*=2 完美一致（K* 之上分辨力本就微弱）\n> - transfer retention 80-92% suggests depth signal has a large text-intrinsic component（不量化具体比例，因 transfer accuracy retention ≠ 信号分解）\n> - ⚠️ 数值精度：Pythia→OLMo 91.6%, OLMo→Pythia 90.3%，范围 90-92%（非 91-92%）；Qwen-cont↔Pythia 84.7%/85.2%，范围 84-85%（非 83-85%）\n\n**(c) Degradation ordering consistency**\n> - Spearman ρ ≥ 0.85 on single-feature AUC ranking（mode-controlled, continuation）\n> - Top discriminative features shared: surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std\n> - Limitation: depth-pair level 一致性在 1v2 处较弱（τ~0.37）\n> - Metric: single-feature AUC ranking（model-free, not LightGBM split count）\n\n**(e) Representation dependence of K* (§4.x Neural Probe / §5.x Discussion)**\n> - exp-015 完整 3 模型结果（frozen self-embeddings + MLP probe, each model probing its own generations）:\n>   - Qwen-cont: K*(neural)=3, 2v3 AUC=0.6159, CI [0.6099, 0.6223], CI lower > 0.60 ✅\n>   - Pythia-1.4B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5963, CI [0.5892, 0.6033], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n>   - OLMo-1B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5892, CI [0.5818, 0.5965], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n> - **K*(neural) 不具备 universality**：仅 Qwen-cont 达到 K*=3，Pythia/OLMo 仍为 K*=2\n> - **Self-familiarity 解释**：每个模型用自己的 frozen embeddings 探测自己生成的文本。Qwen 对 Qwen-generated 文本更敏感（self-familiarity），K*=3 是 model-specific artifact 而非 universal signal\n> - **K*(theory) ≥ 3 弱化**：只能 claim \"K*(theory) ≥ 3 for Qwen representations\"，不能泛化为所有模型\n> - **Interpretability–deployability tradeoff 加强**：15D features 给出 universal K*=2（3/3 模型一致），neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*∈{2,3}。Model-free 方案的 universality 优势在 cross-model 结果下更明显\n> - 所有 3 模型 neural 2v3 AUC > lgbm 2v3 AUC（+3.9pp 到 +5.5pp），说明 learned representations 确实恢复了额外 depth signal，但不足以在所有模型上推过 θ=0.60\n> - 论文定位：**正面发现**——cross-model validation 揭示 K*(neural) 是 representation-dependent，验证了选择 model-free 15D features 作为 headline K* characterization 的正确性\n> - 预防审稿人 \"why bury the stronger result?\"：K*(neural)=3 仅对 Qwen 成立且是 self-familiarity driven，不适合作为 headline result；15D K*=2 的 universality（10/10 conditions + 3/3 models）才是可靠可部署的结论\n\n**(d) Generation mode analysis (§4.x Analysis subsection)**\n> - Signal strength: rewrite AUC 1v2=0.6957 vs continuation 0.6114（Δ=+8.4pp）\n> - Transferability: continuation 80-92% retention vs rewrite 61-63%\n> - Feature subset: cont→rw 89% > rw→cont 82% → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n> - Interpretation: rewrite mode 的 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 但降低跨模型泛化性\n> - 论文定位：Analysis subsection（\"How does generation mode affect depth estimation?\"），不是独立 claim\n\n### Secondary: C3 (K*-Aware Data Curation Validation)\nK*=2 correctly predicts that graduated refinement beyond the binary boundary provides no additional benefit: binary K*-aware filtering (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated depth weighting (best 0.5892 at α=0.9), surprisal-based selection (0.5894), and DSIR distribution matching (~0.5867, ≈ no-filter level). K* serves as an actionable curation guideline — the discrimination boundary directly determines the optimal filtering granularity.\n\n### Supporting Analysis: Canonical Condition Selection\nGeneration mode 是 depth estimation 的显著混淆变量。Methodology 段落阐述 continuation mode 作为 canonical condition 的选择及理由（不作为独立 claim）。\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: Web 数据正被多代递归合成文本污染。当前检测方法将合成文本视为 binary 类别（real vs synthetic），但质量随代际深度非线性退化——首代合成文本与四代合成文本的质量差异巨大却被忽视。\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Binary detectors (DivEye, Min-K%++) 不区分代际；model collapse 文献 (Shumailov et al., Alemohammad et al. 2024, Dohmatob et al. 2024) 描述宏观现象但不提供检测工具；data selection methods (DSIR, D4, DoReMi) 做分布匹配但不估计递归深度；Drayson et al. (2025) 将 binary MGT detection 应用于 importance resampling 以防止 model collapse，是目前最接近的工作。然而这些方法均做二值判断，**不估计文本经历了多少轮递归生成，也不量化辨别能力的饱和边界。**\n- **Our framing**: 将递归生成建模为 iterated lossy channel，从信息论（DPI）推导出 K* 的必然存在。K* 是首次系统测量的 operational quantity——它告诉数据策展者\"在什么深度以下，depth-aware curation 比 binary detection 更有价值\"。通过 10 条件实验矩阵（5 model-mode configurations + 4 decoding strategies + 1 cross-scale 7B）系统表征 K*，揭示其 universality：**K*=2 在所有 10 个测试条件下不变**，表明递归生成存在一个与具体模型架构和解码策略无关的 universal discrimination boundary。这一发现为数据治理提供 actionable guidance——depth-aware filtering 在 K* 以内有效，且无需针对不同模型或解码配置分别调优。\n- **Headline result template**: \"Recursive generation has a universal discrimination boundary at K*=2: invariant across 4 model-mode configurations, 4 decoding strategies, and 1 cross-scale probe (10 conditions total, 1B–7B scale, base+instruct), with cross-model transfer retention of 80-92% confirming depth features are largely text-intrinsic. K*=2 correctly predicts that graduated refinement beyond the binary boundary provides no additional benefit — binary filtering at K* (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms all tested alternatives including graduated weighting, surprisal selection, and DSIR.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n\n1. **\"Universality claim 只基于小模型，能推广到更大模型吗？\"** → exp-004 已将规模扩展至 7B（Qwen2.5-7B, continuation mode, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B），K*=2 依然成立，bootstrap 95% CI 确认。结合 4 个 ≤1.5B 架构族（GPT-2 style, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen），K*=2 在 1B–7B 范围内稳定。DPI 理论保证 K*_theory 对任意规模模型存在；进一步扩展至 13B+/70B+ 是重要 future work\n2. **\"只是 feature engineering + off-the-shelf classifier，方法贡献弱\"** → 贡献在 problem formulation + empirical characterization（首次测量 K*）+ 理论框架（DPI）+ universality 发现，不是分类器本身\n3. **\"Prompt-chain 不代表真实世界递归污染\"** → retrain-chain ecological validity check 作为补充；prompt-chain 是 controlled experiment 的标准方法\n4. **\"K*=2 太浅，graduated filtering 收益有限\"** → K*=2 恰好预测了这一结果：binary filtering at K* boundary (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated weighting (best 0.5892), surprisal selection (0.5894), and DSIR (~0.5867). 这验证了 K* 作为 actionable curation guideline 的价值——discrimination boundary 直接决定了最优 filtering 粒度。K* 的 universality 意味着实践者无需为每个模型/解码配置单独标定阈值\n5. **\"同模型做生成和 surprisal 计算有 bias\"** → **exp-013 直接反驳**：Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention，0v1 transfer AUC > 0.96。Depth signal 主要编码在文本而非 model self-familiarity\n6. **\"为什么不用 learned representations\"** → **exp-015 直接回应**：frozen LLM embeddings + MLP probe 达到 K*=3（vs 15D K*=2），揭示 representation-dependent hierarchy: K*_theory ≥ K*_neural ≥ K*_15D。Hand-crafted 15D features 的优势在于 model-free transferability（80-92% cross-model retention）、可解释性（支持 degradation ordering 分析）、实用可部署性。Neural representations 多辨别 1 个深度级别但代价是 model dependence + ~100x 计算开销。这一 tradeoff 证明 15D features 是 practical choice，同时表明 theoretical boundary 延伸至 K*=2 之上\n7. **\"Graduated filtering 没和 data selection methods 比\"** → exp-006 包含 DSIR baseline + α sensitivity sweep\n8. **\"Decoding strategy 只测了 4 种，coverage 不够\"** → 覆盖了实践中最常见的 decoding 配置（greedy, nucleus sampling, temperature scaling high/low）；4/4 完全一致强化 universality claim；extreme decoding（top-k=1 之外的 pathological 配置）留作 future work\n9. **\"为什么不直接用 LLM 做 depth estimation\"** → **exp-011 直接反驳**：GPT-5.5 和 Claude Opus 4.6 在 500 样本 zero-shot 5-class depth 分类上仅 33.1-33.2% accuracy（MAE ~1.1），低于 OBD 15-feature LightGBM 的 38.6%。二者 binary detection 均 ~88%，说明 LLM 能区分 human vs synthetic 但无法估计递归深度。depth estimation 是非平凡任务，需要专用特征工程\n\n## Venue Fit\n\n- EMNLP 2026 special theme 明确呼吁 data contamination, synthetic data feedback loops, data governance 方向的工作\n- 2+1 claim 结构：C1' 是 comprehensive characterization study with universality finding，C3 是 practical application，generation mode analysis 增加深度\n- Universality narrative 比 controllability 更有 impact：从 \"K* depends on X, Y, Z\" 升级为 \"K*=2 is a universal boundary\"，审稿人更容易记住和传播\n- 风险：universality claim 在 ≤1.5B 规模下的外推性是最大攻击面 → 论文中 scope 明确、limitation 诚实、DPI 理论支撑泛化的合理性\n","numLines":127,"startLine":1,"totalLines":127}}}
